  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Regional: Africa Climate Week (ACW) Side Event: Role of Land Governance in Catalyzing Climate Justice and Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: Policymakers, practitioners, businesses and civil society. Indirect beneficiaries: Judiciaries and local communities in East African countries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to contribute to improving land conflict management by reinforcing efforts to strengthen the rule of law and inclusive governance over land and natural resources.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the existing knowledge and tools on how to improve legal frameworks and strengthen formal and informal justice mechanisms to ensure conflict prevention and climate Justice.</narrative>
  </description>
